WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.949 --> 00:00:02.970
All right, everybody, we're back.

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.480
Janine Turner is coming
up in just a minute.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.300
It'll be great to have
her on the program and-

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.400
Excuse me, Conan? Andy?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.320
Oh, hey!

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.150
Folks, it's Todd.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.430
He's one of our security
guards here at the program.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.120
I'm sorry to bother you during the show,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.880
but there's this woman out
here who doesn't have a ticket

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.193
and she keeps insisting
on coming in anyway.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:25.770
Well, you can't interrupt
the show, I mean,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.310
you'll just have to tell her
to come back another time.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.980
Well, I would tell her to come back, Andy,

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.428
but she keeps claiming
she's your little sister.

00:00:32.428 --> 00:00:35.235
(audience laughs)
Hey, Andy!

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.300
(Andy groans)
Oh, hi, yeah.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.270
No, that is Andy's little sister, Stacy.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:41.110
Hey there, Stacy.

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:43.017
Hi Stacy.
Hi Conan!

00:00:43.017 --> 00:00:45.800
Yeah, we didn't know
you were coming today,

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.834
but it's really nice to see you again.

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:49.773
It is?

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:54.790
Stacy, remember how we
decided maybe it was better

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:57.770
if you didn't come to the show
for a while? Remember that?

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.630
Yeah, I know, Andy. I'm sorry.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:02.530
But last time I was here
I totally spazzed out

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.743
like a super dork.

00:01:04.636 --> 00:01:07.110
Well, it's okay, Stacy.

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:10.720
Yeah, you were upset because
you have a crush on Conan

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.593
and you found out he
doesn't feel the same way.

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:18.380
Andy, why don't you go, like,
tell Russia or something?

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:21.354
Look, Andy didn't mean to embarrass you.

00:01:21.354 --> 00:01:24.636
I just don't wanna see
you get hurt, that's all.

00:01:24.636 --> 00:01:25.969
[Audience] Aw!

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:27.653
You don't?

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.480
Stacy, last time you were
here you got pretty upset.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:38.480
Look, since then I have
grown so much emotionally.

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:43.053
Stacy, that was four weeks
ago. That was a month.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:46.710
I know that, but with the help

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:49.570
of both transcendental meditation

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.473
and my Judy Blume books,

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.850
I have come to terms with
my feelings for Conan,

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.840
and I now know that I need to concentrate

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.060
on boys my own age.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:05.060
So I brought some
pictures to show you guys.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:08.693
This is my room when I used
to be obsessed with Conan.

00:02:08.693 --> 00:02:10.980
(audience laughs)

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.270
And here's my room now.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.157
Check it out!

00:02:17.293 --> 00:02:18.235
Yeah!

00:02:18.235 --> 00:02:21.235
(audience applauds)

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:26.510
There's a sign in there
that says I Luv Hanson.

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:27.343
Yeah, yeah.
Yeah, we saw.

00:02:27.343 --> 00:02:28.650
I love the middle one.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:31.300
Yeah.
Yeah, but Stacy,

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:34.940
your room is still
basically a shrine to Conan.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:37.980
Okay, I appreciate your concern, Andy,

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:40.380
but I want you to know
that I am totally glad

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.243
that Conan already has a girlfriend.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.860
You are?
Sure.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.330
Without her there'd be
nobody to compare me to,

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.130
and then you would never realize that I am

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:52.983
your true, ultimate soulmate.

00:02:52.983 --> 00:02:54.565
(audience laughs)

00:02:54.565 --> 00:02:55.770
What?

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.730
Don't fight it, Conan.

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.010
We all need to experience
rejection of a relationship

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.990
in order to make room for
the arrival of true love.

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:07.340
Now, wait, Tracy, I don't
think you, you, you...

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:09.274
Or Stacy, I'm sorry. (chuckles)

00:03:09.274 --> 00:03:12.933
(audience laughs)

00:03:12.933 --> 00:03:14.820
Look, I...
(audience applauds)

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.900
Look, I don't think you understand.

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:21.560
I really am flattered, but
I like you as a friend,

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.393
and only as a friend.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:25.393
What?

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.653
Come on, don't you think
we could be friends?

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.730
Oh, yeah.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.080
Sure.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.533
Let's be friends.

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:41.360
Tell you what, why don't I just sit down

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.453
and watch my friend do his little show,

00:03:45.663 --> 00:03:46.862
all right?

00:03:46.862 --> 00:03:48.040
Have a seat, all right?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.850
I'm sure this gentleman won't mind moving.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:51.683
Sir?

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.382
(audience laughs)

00:03:55.382 --> 00:03:59.253
(laughs) No, I'm sorry. I
waited all day for this seat.

00:04:00.612 --> 00:04:02.661
Get outta here, musclehead!

00:04:02.661 --> 00:04:05.601
Before I break you in
half like a Twix bar!

00:04:05.601 --> 00:04:06.434
Move it!

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:09.903
[Conan] Stacy!

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.910
(audience applauds)
Come on!

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:13.983
You know it!

00:04:13.983 --> 00:04:16.390
Bring it!
Stacy, take it easy!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.070
Take it easy, Stacy.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.983
You shut your hole, Richter!

00:04:25.022 --> 00:04:28.909
I got a sock full of batteries
with your name on it!

00:04:28.909 --> 00:04:30.430
Come on!

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:31.550
Oh my...

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:32.750
Oh my god!
Come on!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.840
I'll tell ya, I am outta here, everybody!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.560
But I promise you I'll be back!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:42.560
And when I do the walls will
tremble in the wake of my fury!

00:04:43.542 --> 00:04:48.330
And you, O'Brien, you will
hang, drawn and quartered,

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.243
on the frayed ropes of my vengeance!

00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:55.459
Are you there, God? It's me, Stacy!

00:04:58.531 --> 00:05:01.054
(audience applauds)
Yeah!

00:05:01.054 --> 00:05:02.584
Whoo!

00:05:02.584 --> 00:05:04.214
Yeah!
Stacy!

00:05:04.214 --> 00:05:05.323
[Stacy] Whoo!

00:05:05.323 --> 00:05:06.156
Stacy!

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:12.020
Stacy! Stacy, stop doing that, okay?

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:15.000
I don't even know what that
is. Now, I'm sorry I upset you.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.210
Don't you understand? I really like you.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.800
I'm sorry too.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:24.420
I mean, for some, puberty
is a sign of awakening,

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:29.420
but for me puberty is a raging
sea of psychosexual turmoil.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:30.563
Well, wait a minute.

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.180
Well, then why don't you just sit down

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.336
and we'll get you some popcorn and then-

00:05:34.336 --> 00:05:37.440
I can't eat popcorn 'cause
it gets stuck in my braces!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.130
All right! Okay, just take it easy!

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:42.210
We're gonna take a little
break, we'll think of something.

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.460
We'll be right back with-

